'''Magma''', or '''lava''', was dangerous fluid, molten rock. Often emanating from [[volcano]]es,<ref name="JTS">[[Star Wars: Journey Through Space (2015)|''Star Wars: Journey Through Space'']]</ref> lava was extremely hot at thousands of degrees,<ref name="Episode III">{{Film|III}}</ref> but when it stopped flowing, the substance cooled and hardened, eventually forming [[obsidian]]<ref name="TC">''[[Battlefront: Twilight Company]]''</ref> or dark lava sand.<ref name="ROS explore">{{SW|url=films/star-wars-episode-iii-revenge-of-the-sith|text=''Star Wars: Revenge of the Sith''}} {{C|Story Gallery: Slide 47}}</ref>

